Package: Atlas3
Type: Package
Title: Client for OHDSI ATLAS 3.0 and WebAPI 3.0
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Jamie", "Gilbert", email = "gilbert@ohdsi.org",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A modern client for the OHDSI ATLAS 3.0 and WebAPI 3.0 REST
    interface. Discovers a deployment from its URL, negotiates the WebAPI
    version, authenticates with personal API keys or database login, and
    provides typed access to sources, vocabularies, concept sets, cohort
    definitions, cohort definition sets, CDM results, jobs, and analysis
    resources. Cohort definition sets are portable JSON or ZIP bundles
    containing cohort expressions and their embedded concept sets. The
    package targets ATLAS 3.0 and newer only.
